Package: beyla
Version: 0.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: alloy (>= 1.21.0), systemd, debconf, python3
Maintainer: Gregor Zeitlinger <gregor.zeitlinger@grafana.com>
Description: Experimental Beyla instrumentation package for Ubuntu
 Experimental Ubuntu amd64 package that configures Grafana Alloy to collect
 Beyla application telemetry, host metrics and profiles, with optional SDK
 instrumentation for explicitly selected systemd services.
